        "id": "FioraQ",
        "name": "Lunge",
        "description": "Fiora lunges in a direction and stabs a nearby enemy, dealing physical damage and applying on-hit effects.",
        "tooltip": "Fiora lunges in a direction and stabs the closest enemy, ward, or structure, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">70/80/90/100/110 physical damage</span>. The strike will prioritize <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Vitals</span> and enemies it will kill.<br /><br />If Fiora strikes an enemy, this Ability's Cooldown is reduced by 50%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The strike applies On-Hit Effects.</span>",
